  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-应用、小程序与游戏\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"在母包package创建成功后，支持AD、巨量引擎工作台-旧版及巨量引擎工作台-升级版客户创建应用分包。创建母包需前往投放平台-资产-移动应用，可通过「查询应用信息」接口查询应用包ID。\",\"id\":\"ad.app_extend_package.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/app_management/extend_package/create_v2/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1710414234180623\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能进行创建应用分包操作\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.app_info.query\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"创建应用分包需要通过此接口查询应用包ID\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"查询应用信息\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code.query\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"创建应用分包的应答结果需要参考此文档的返回码说明\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1710414234180623\",\"title\":\"创建安卓应用分包 （支持所有账户体系）\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-m0N0NJGP\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vhutel2P\">创建应用分包，支持所有账户体系下创建应用分包</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-MWa99Qlo\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">母包package创建成功后，可以通过当前接口创建分包，支持AD、巨量引擎工作台-旧版及巨量引擎工作台-升级版客户。</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hC3RWKvU\"><br/></p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-9hpWgys6%5C%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8DAPI%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%AF%8D%E5%8C%85package%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%AF%8D%E5%8C%85%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%89%8D%E5%BE%80%20%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0-%E8%B5%84%E4%BA%A7-%E7%A7%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xZGUw%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-9hpWgys6%5C%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8DAPI%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%AF%8D%E5%8C%85package%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%AF%8D%E5%8C%85%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%89%8D%E5%BE%80%20%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0-%E8%B5%84%E4%BA%A7-%E7%A7%BB%E5%8A%A8%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193